       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. BILLING.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  BALANCE          PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE 0.
       01  TRANSACTION-AMT  PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE 0.
       01  STATUS-CODE      PIC 9 VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN.
           MOVE 125 TO TRANSACTION-AMT
           PERFORM APPLY-TRANSACTION
           GO TO APPROVE-TRANSACTION REJECT-TRANSACTION
               DEPENDING ON STATUS-CODE.
       APPLY-TRANSACTION.
           ADD TRANSACTION-AMT TO BALANCE
           IF BALANCE > 100000
               MOVE 1 TO STATUS-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 2 TO STATUS-CODE
           END-IF.
       APPROVE-TRANSACTION.
           DISPLAY "APPROVED" BALANCE
           GOBACK.
       REJECT-TRANSACTION.
           DISPLAY "REVIEW REQUIRED" BALANCE
           GOBACK.